      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SLIDE CITY (6) is a Darren Russell-trained newcomer by Fabregas out of Zipping Winks. Strong market watch advised but profiles nicely for this. LUNA JANE (3) was in the minors two back (19.94) at Q Lakeside but ran below best last time there, finishing 8th. Likely to be thereabouts. ALL BARK (1) was narrowly beaten when placing two back but missed the frame latest finishing eighth (20.80) in a Maiden at Q Lakeside. Well placed here and can atone this time. HOOKED ON HER (8) is an improver who can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track when making debut.",
